       "alt": "A storybook painting of a small town at dusk inside the mouth of a huge cave, seen from a rooftop. In the foreground a grey tabby cat sits on red roof tiles beside a lit lantern and an open ledger, looking down. Below, a cobbled square with a long table under strings of lights, crowded with people and small glowing lantern-shaped figures eating and talking. Top left, an open gate with newcomers carrying suitcases. Around the square: a workshop where a man plays a one-stringed instrument on a long box, a glass greenhouse glowing green, a shop window of geodes and crystals, an old wooden radio on a windowsill, a man sitting inside a white box, a porch with a bell and two chairs, a white rabbit beside chalk hopscotch squares, a fountain with a yellow rubber duck on its rim, and a newspaper kiosk with a striped awning. Behind, more lit houses, bridges and waterfalls recede into the cave.",
